<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Irish industrial output rises 5.0 pct in Oct.</title>
<headline>Irish industrial output rises 5.0 pct in Oct.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irish industrial production rose a seasonally adjusted 5.0 percent in October after a 3.1 percent fall in September, Central Statistics Office (CSO) data showed on Tuesday.  </p>
<p>Manufacturing production rose 5.5 percent in October after a fall of 0.4 percent the previous month.</p>
